    "original": "We apply our evaluation pipeline to two corpora of 15 recent astrophysics arXiv preprints and 15 ML preprints, benchmarking SKEPTHICAL alongside eleven additional reviewer systems: six single-LLM reviewers, two Claude Code configurations, and three publicly available external AI reviewers (the Stanford Agentic Reviewer [16], OpenReviewer-8B [8], and the PaperAudit-Bench detector [20]). To our knowledge, our application to the astrophysics corpus is the first controlled comparison of AI peer-reviewer systems on a real, non-ML scientific paper corpus. We release the evaluation pipeline, together with the paper lists, injection catalogues, and full adjudication logs, as a public benchmark at github.com/inigozubeldia/skepthical-benchmark.",
    "source_lines": [
      "Weapplyourevaluationpipelinetotwocorporaof15recentastrophysicsarXivpreprintsand15ML",
      "preprints,benchmarkingSKEPTHICALalongsideelevenadditionalreviewersystems:sixsingle-LLM",
      "reviewers,twoClaudeCodeconfigurations,andthreepubliclyavailableexternalAIreviewers(the",
      "StanfordAgenticReviewer[16],OpenReviewer-8B[8],andthePaperAudit-Benchdetector[20]).",
      "Toourknowledge,ourapplicationtotheastrophysicscorpusisthefirstcontrolledcomparisonofAI",
      "peer-reviewersystemsonareal,non-MLscientificpapercorpus.Wereleasetheevaluationpipeline,",
      "togetherwiththepaperlists,injectioncatalogues,andfulladjudicationlogs,asapublicbenchmark",
      "atgithub.com/inigozubeldia/skepthical-benchmark."
    ]
  },
